{"schema_version":1,"resources":{"catalogs/runtime/scenes/c34f435cc8b24bca7308.json":{"assets":{"ep3/quest_story_13113090":{"skip":{"source_cn":"你们试图救下鏖战的战士，但却无法对他们产生任何影响。在士兵们的交谈中，你们得知他们守住这条通道是为了支援瓦丽卡——瓦丽卡就在前方！","text_i18n":{"cn":"你们试图救下鏖战的战士，但却无法对他们产生任何影响。在士兵们的交谈中，你们得知他们守住这条通道是为了支援瓦丽卡——瓦丽卡就在前方！","en":"You try to help the warriors, but your actions have no effect. From the soldiers, you learn that they are reinforcements for Valka—she is right ahead!","jp":"死力を尽くして戦う戦士たちを助けたくても、どうやら干渉はできないようだ。兵士たちの会話から、彼らがヴェリカのためにこの道を死守していることが分かった。この先にヴェリカがいるに違いない！","kr":"우리는 격전 중인 전사를 구하려고 했지만, 그들에게 아무런 영향도 줄 수 없었다. 병사들과의 대화를 통해 우리는 그들이 발리카를 지원하기 위해서 이 통로를 지키고 있다는 것을 알게 되었다. 발리카가 바로 저 앞에 있다!"},"source":"Plot.SkipText","plot_ids":["13113090"],"localization_status":"exact_hash","record_indices":["23903"]}}}},"locales/cn/ep3/quest_story/13113090.json":{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13113090","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13113090","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1311309001:0":{"text":"小心！你怎么样？","source_cn":"小心！你怎么样？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCFC530C7CB7A1F7A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1311309002:0":{"text":"我没事……多谢你！","source_cn":"我没事……多谢你！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x26756AFCB5C2E651","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1311309003:0":{"text":"不要停下来，继续前进<style=\"highlight\">去支援瓦丽卡将军</style>！快！","source_cn":"不要停下来，继续前进<style=highlight>...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4878963DCA479DDE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_titl